## The help: every command (`cli-cmd-<path>`, `.about`) and every argument (`cli-arg-<path>-<id>`, `.help`) of `bisa`, as the derive spells them in its doc comments; `crates/bisa-cli/src/localize.rs` holds the two equal and says them in the person's language.

